    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūcha kwa ng'wa Musa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Musa ūja kū lūgūlū lwa Nebo kūfuma ū kū mbūga ya Moabu, ūūkalinha kwigūlya ya lūgūlū lwa Pisiga, ūlo lwalī lwilolile na Yeliko ū kū ntambūko gwa mongo. Aho alī kwenūko ū SEEBA ūng'oolekeja pyī ī sī, kwandīja Gileadi kūja Dani; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pye a mabbaala ga Nafutali, ī sī ya Efulaimu na Manase. Wībona pyī ī sī ya Yuda kūshisha kū nyanza ya ng'weli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wībona nī Negevu nī sī ī yose kwandīja ntubīlo gwa Yeliko ū kū nzengo gwa minaji, kūshisha Zoali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla, “Ī yenīyī hū yene ī sī īyo naalī nabisagīja mu kwilahīla ba Abulahamu, Isaka, na Yakobo, aho nakabawīla gīkī, ‘Nakūbinha banhū ba shibyalīlwe shing'we.’ Naakūzunīlīja ū bebe wībone na miso gako, alīyo ūtūkīla ūshike ko.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Musa ū ntūmami o ng'wa SEEBA, ūchīla mu sī ya Moabu, gīt'ūmo SEEBA walī wahayīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūnjīka Moabu kwenūko, mu sī ya ntubīlo yilolile na Beti-peoli; gwike nī lelo īyī atīho nūūlū ūmò ūyo amanile aho shilī ī shigila shakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Musa aho alīcha walī na būlamu wa myaka igana na makūmi abīlī, alīyo a miso gakwe gaalī gataalī gūūbona chiza no, nī nguzu jakwe jalī jitaalī ū kūgeeha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū a Baisilaeli būnīla ū Musa shikū makūmi adatū, ū mu mbūga ya Moabu ng'wenūmo, kūshisha lyūshila ī likanza lya kūlīla kwabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, ū Yoshwa walī ookala moyo gwa witegeleja, nguno ū Musa walī wantūūlīla makono gakwe. Hūna lūūlū būng'wigwa a Baisilaeli, bīīta pyī īyo SEEBA walī wanagīīla Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo kūfuma ikanza lyenīlo kūshisha lelo īyī, ataalī kwilonga ng'hangi ūngī mu Baisilaeli wa kūbiza gītī Musa; ūyo SEEBA walī amanile būshū kū būshū, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūyo akīīta pyī ī shimanīkījo sha kūkumya nī mihayo ya kūkamaaja īyo SEEBA akantūma kwīyīta mu sī ya Misili, kūlī Falao na a batūmami bakwe, nū mu sī yakwe ī yose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atīho ūngī hangī ūyo wabīta koolecha mihayo ya būdūla būtaale gīko, nūūlū ūyo wīta mihayo ya magaka gītī īyo wītaga Musa mu būtongi wa Baisilaeli bose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
